                    <li>[What the tech involved — any hardware, sensors, bespoke software?]</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>The outcome</h2>
                <p>[Exhibition ran dates]. [Visitor numbers, press, awards if any — worth checking if publicly available.]</p>
